# Keys tune the carrier: A2, E3, A3, C5 held in ring mode on a sine, then up-shift with the knob back at P1.
tempo 120
steps 40
tail 0.2
track fx1
input sine 330 0.5
param p1 60
param p2 128
param pan 255
param level 255
gain 1
note 0 A2 6
note 8 E3 6
note 16 A3 6
note 24 C5 6
param p2 255 30
expect sound 0 40
expect peak_below 0
